 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * A real Frontier journal `Loadout` event for the current fit of an exploration Caspian Explorer
 * (34 `Modules` entries, two heat-sink launchers). The EDSY export of an earlier fit of the same
 * ship is `slef-the-deep-black.jsonc`.
 *
 * Contributed 2026-08-10 UTC by the repository owner from their own fleet, with no upstream
 * project. The pasted source line has SHA-256
 * `dc6ead5c6fbd0ceea835770f6056fd59f6dc5db470c823fef527a93b29ba3398`; the stored, re-indented
 * fixture has SHA-256 `c4c4734b4bb332d235115666842939fb4a38743d4573ad25cb731c3a3c022dc8`.
 *
 * `ShipName`, `ShipIdent`, `ShipID` and `timestamp` are kept — they describe a ship, and nothing
 * in the event names a person. The engineer names are the game's own NPCs.
 *
 * The capture is Elite Dangerous game output and remains the property of Frontier Developments
 * plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage terms; see ATTRIBUTIONS.md.

 *
 * A stored checksum here is of the payload alone, taken with this header comment removed; a source
 * checksum is of the upstream file as it was received.
 */
